---
description: Python conventions for Opptra services
globs: backend/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

Use Python 3.12, uv, Ruff, and pytest.

Keep HTTP routes under /api. Log JSON to stdout through the app logger. Fields are severity, message, service, and environment.

Put tests in backend/tests. A behavior change lands with a test in the same pull request once the repo has a test suite.
